<title>USA: Pacific Gulf Properties offers 2.1 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Pacific Gulf Properties offers 2.1 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1997-06-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Gulf Properties Inc on Friday said it is offering 2.1 million common shares at $21.00 per share via sole underwriter Prudential Securities Inc.</p>
<p>Net proceeds of roughly $41.6 million will be used to fund acquisitions and repay outstanding indebtedness.</p>
<p>The transaction is scheduled to close on June 11, 1997.</p>
</text>
